---
id: api-errors
paths: ["src/routes/**"]
summary: Use HttpError for all 4xx/5xx responses.
source: { kind: human, ref: "team decision 2026-11" }   # kind: proposal | compound | human
added: 2026-11-20
reason: Ad-hoc error bodies broke the public error contract twice.
retire_when: "a lint rule (no-adhoc-error-body) enforces this"
hits: 0
helpful: 0
harmful: 0
---
Return errors with `throw new HttpError(status, code)` from `src/http/errors.ts`.
Do not build error JSON by hand.
